From ef203bea5d27e48011b68002fc120ed3aa8a9ca1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:36:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add auto-resume launcher for LLM-pretrained-init distillation

run_dagger_distill_llmpt.sh starts the GT-teacher distillation student from
model_step_460000.pt and resumes from the latest ckpt.iter*.pth when one
exists (IL.load_from_ckpt + IL.is_requeue). eval_run.sh evaluates any
LLM-Grid Try5 run's checkpoint into the layout the analysis scripts read.
The R7 task book describes the automated execution and monitoring.

